### Necessário para pegar o token
### Post
# @name loginAutenticado
POST http://localhost:40000/Login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "admin"
}

### Seta o token
@accessToken = {{loginAutenticado.response.body.$.token}}

###

### sem token
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllPiquetes HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

###

### pasto inexistente
POST http://localhost:40000/insertPiquete HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "descricao": "Piquete sem pasto",
    "latitude": -20.42,
    "longitude": -49.97,
    "pastoidfk": 999999
}

###

### teste de inserção de piquete
POST http://localhost:40000/insertPiquete HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "descricao": "Piquete S2",
    "latitude": -20.431500,
